WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:12.490
When it deals battle damage, the opponent 
discards one card from his hand.

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:14.990
And you get to draw one card.

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:25.270
Black Rose Dragon!

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:27.110
Aki…

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:29.110
There’s something wrong with her.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.580
Burn her to a crisp!

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:33.910
Black Rose Flare!

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:42.990
It’s Aki’s psychic power!

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:44.190
It's very powerful!

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:46.190
I end my turn.

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:54.370
That's the power that took Toby’s life.

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:57.090
I won't forgive you!

00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:00.170
Come forth, ancient seal!

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:30.650
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:35.750
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:40.660
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:45.430
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:50.790
No matter how bad today is

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:55.770
There's still the faintest light

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:01.180
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:05.240
Is light it myself

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:10.250
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:15.220
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:21.520
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:25.500
Today will never exist again

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:31.400
So I won't stop or vanish

00:02:55.400 --> 00:03:00.910
At the End of Truth

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:12.710
Aki, show her that your 
true power is superior!

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:14.760
Squash her!

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:20.550
Ushio, hurry!

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:23.050
I know!

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:26.750
Save me, Master Atlas!

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:32.760
Why Jack?

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:34.740
You saved us, Ushio!

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:41.700
The duel has already started.

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:43.400
Yusei, wait!

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:46.900
Misty thinks Aki killed her brother.

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:49.110
What?  Is that true?

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:53.700
I don’t know, but Aki 
doesn’t remember doing that.

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:57.910
My turn.  I draw.

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:01.150
Sorrowful Memories's effect is still active.

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:06.300
The monster card I drew returns 
to my deck and is shuffled.

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:10.560
In regards to Dragon Queen of Tragic 
Endings that you just destroyed,

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:15.660
I can Special Summon it by sending one 
Continuous Spell on my field to the graveyard.

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:21.140
I send the Continuous Spell Sad Story 
– Sorrowful Memories to the graveyard.

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:24.440
I Special Summon Dragon 
Queen of Tragic Endings!

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:34.350
Then from my hand, I equip the Equip Spell 
Reptilianne Rage on Dragon Queen of Tragic Endings.

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.930
It gains 800 attack points.

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:43.290
Battle!  I'll disperse those petals!

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:47.530
I activate my trap Rose Blizzard!

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:51.980
When a monster on my field 
is the target of attack, it

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:55.980
negates your monster’s attack and 
switches it to defense position.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:05:01.070
You managed to survive this 
time, but what about next time?

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:03.250
I end my turn.

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:06.930
Rua!  Ruka!

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:08.310
Yusei!

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:10.330
Yusei, Aki is dueling.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.440
But there’s something wrong with her!

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:13.690
Aki…

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:17.190
Aki has changed back to her past self.

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:20.750
Aki, what happened?

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:26.030
Aki, fight!

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:27.580
Fight!

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:34.510
He’s…

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:43.510
I see.  He was in disguise!

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:45.050
You stay here!

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:46.720
Yusei!

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:49.110
My turn.  I draw!

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:56.470
Black Rose Dragon’s effect activates by 
removing Rose Fairy in my graveyard from play.

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:00.440
Rose Restriction!

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:07.140
Dragon Queen of Tragic Endings is forced into 
attack position, and its attack points become zero.

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:08.610
What?

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:10.130
Well done, Aki!

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:12.670
Since your powers are no longer restrained,

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:15.670
you don’t need to be 
afraid of the Dark Signers.

00:06:15.670 --> 00:06:16.320
Do it!

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:24.830
You!

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:26.830
You’re still alive!

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:31.670
Battle!  Black Rose Flare!

00:06:36.010 --> 00:06:40.660
If you stand in my way, I'll eliminate you.

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:46.960
Since Reptilianne Rage was 
destroyed and sent to the

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:51.460
graveyard, your Black Rose 
Dragon loses 800 attack points.

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:56.150
I summon Dark Verger in defense position!

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:02.660
I end my turn.

00:07:03.140 --> 00:07:04.960
It’s your turn.

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:09.180
Aki...

00:07:09.180 --> 00:07:11.590
If you don’t hurry up and win this duel...

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:13.680
The sun will set.

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:15.880
What’s your goal?

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.770
Why are you here?

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:23.750
Since the Dark Signers attacked Arcadia 
Movement, this happened to me.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:27.790
But Aki’s mind control is perfect.

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:29.890
Mind control?

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:33.570
Aki won't listen to anyone except for me.

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:38.900
I'll use Aki’s power to get my 
revenge on everyone who hurt me.

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:41.070
Set Aki free!

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:42.770
Aki has changed her ways!

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.780
Changed her ways?

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:47.580
Aki is my faithful servant!

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:50.060
I'll decide everything for Aki!

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:51.280
What?

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:57.860
I won’t let you control a person’s soul!

00:07:58.280 --> 00:08:02.060
Everyone does what I want them to do.

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:07.200
I can make them do what I want 
by striking at their weaknesses.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:09.200
Just like Aki!

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:14.670
Though she had incredible psychic 
powers, Aki’s heart was alone.

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:17.640
So all I had to do was mess with her heart.

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:19.380
How dare you!

00:08:19.380 --> 00:08:21.370
Misty is also pathetic.

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:24.380
She became a Dark Signer and 
challenged a psychic duelist

00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:27.380
because she wants revenge for 
the death of her brother Toby.

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:29.720
Such beautiful love between siblings.

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:33.090
But it’s her destiny to lose against Aki.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:37.620
In regards to the death of 
Misty’s brother Toby, there

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:41.120
have been anonymous reports to the 
Public Maintenance Department.

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:45.000
Arcadia Movement may be 
manipulating the information.

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:49.470
Were you the one who led Misty 
into becoming a Dark Signer?

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:53.240
Even I didn’t expect to go that far.

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:59.180
But it became the perfect opportunity 
to show the powers of a psychic duelist.

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:01.890
“Go that far.”

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:03.920
You let the cat out of the bag, Divine!

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:08.530
You had something to do with Toby’s death!

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:11.260
If so, what are you going to do about it?

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:17.370
My turn.  I draw!

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:21.910
I summon Reptilianne Gardna 
in defense position!

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:28.980
I send the Continuous Spell Sad Story 
- Unwavering Truth to the graveyard.

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:33.490
I can now Special Summon Dragon Queen 
of Tragic Endings from my graveyard!

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:39.850
As long as I have a Continuous 
Spell on my field,

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:42.550
Dragon Queen of Tragic Endings 
will keep resurrecting.

00:09:42.550 --> 00:09:44.510
You'll perish this time!

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:48.570
Dragon Queen of Tragic Endings 
attacks Black Rose Dragon!

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:50.330
Tragedy Stream!

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:58.210
Dragon Queen of Tragic Endings’s 
monster effect activates!

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:04.930
When it deals battle damage, you select one 
card in your hand and send it to the graveyard.

00:10:06.150 --> 00:10:09.970
Then I get to draw one card.

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:13.620
I end my turn.

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:15.130
My turn.

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:20.830
I activate the spell card Fragrance Storm.

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:27.810
By destroying one Plant-Type 
monster, I can draw one more card.

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:37.010
If the card I draw is a Plant-Type monster, 
I can show it to you and draw one more card.

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:40.020
I draw!

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:44.190
I summon Copy Plant from my 
hand in defense position!

00:10:47.550 --> 00:10:55.000
When I summon a Plant-Type Tuner, I can 
Special Summon Dark Verger from my graveyard.

00:10:57.180 --> 00:11:01.910
What's the point of gathering 
all those low-Level monsters?

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:28.340
Rua!  Ruka!

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:29.700
Are you okay?

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.680
Who’s winning?

00:11:32.770 --> 00:11:34.540
Aki is winning.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:35.410
But...

00:11:36.110 --> 00:11:37.220
But?

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:40.210
I set two cards.

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:42.450
I end my turn.

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:44.450
It’s my turn.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:45.380
I draw.

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:48.950
With this, it’s all over.

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:52.420
I activate the Continuous Spell 
Advance Force from my hand!

00:11:53.460 --> 00:12:00.000
Due to this card's effect, Dragon Queen of Tragic 
Endings counts as two monsters when it’s released!

00:12:00.350 --> 00:12:03.470
This god resurrected our lives!

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:06.800
I offer you my soul!

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:10.870
Descend, Earthbound Immortal Ccarayhua!

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:15.240
That’s…

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:16.650
It can’t be!

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:48.510
You planned this all, Divine!

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:55.690
You killed Misty’s brother 
and made Aki take the fall!

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:58.720
So you figured it out.

00:12:58.720 --> 00:12:59.690
You’re right.

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:02.390
I was the one who killed Misty’s brother.

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:06.790
I killed him a year ago!

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:19.370
Increase the power.

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:21.610
But that'll be too dangerous!

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:32.130
If this is Toby’s full potential, 
then I have no use for him.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:34.580
Just do it!  Increase the power!

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:35.900
Okay!

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:46.150
Toby couldn’t survive the experiment.

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:48.810
He was useless.

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:51.510
He was screaming even though it 
was only a low-level experiment.

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:54.870
On the other hand, Aki is excellent.

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:57.740
She always meets my expectations.

00:13:57.740 --> 00:13:59.180
You…

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:01.690
You won't get away with this!

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.190
Die.

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:14.730
You never give up.

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:18.020
You'll disappear forever this time!

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:20.840
Why are you laughing?

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:24.180
My Duel Disk is homemade.

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:27.790
I had my multi-duel voice network turned on.

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:28.840
What?

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:33.120
Misty heard everything!

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:39.480
Divine, you…

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:42.190
You killed Toby!

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.200
So what?

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.650
Your brother didn’t have any abilities!

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:51.130
I don't need useless people!

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:53.340
I won’t forgive you.

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:12.720
It ate him!

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:16.530
Toby, I got your revenge.

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:19.930
Aki.

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:23.400
I’m sorry.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:26.600
It wasn’t your fault that Toby died.

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:32.810
I no longer have a reason to battle.

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:35.510
I surrender.

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:39.480
I won’t let you do that.

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:43.490
Inside my body...

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:46.460
The god inside my body...

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:51.730
Defeat her!  Defeat the Signer!

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:53.060
Misty!

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:55.870
Your revenge is over!

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:57.570
Aki, wake up!

00:15:57.570 --> 00:15:58.800
Aki!

00:15:59.110 --> 00:16:00.910
Yusei’s voice...

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:03.570
I hear Yusei’s voice.

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:11.520
I can't stop this duel anymore!

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:12.980
Misty!

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:16.190
Misty, don’t let the evil god beat you!

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:21.270
Aki, please defeat me!

00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:28.670
The duty of a Dark Signer 
is to defeat the Signers!

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:32.090
The evil god has taken 
control of Misty’s body!

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:32.940
Aki!

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:36.120
You’re the only one who can stop Misty!

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:37.380
Right!

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:39.180
I’ll finish you!

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:41.180
I attack you directly!

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:44.550
I activate the trap Ground Capture!

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:51.090
I only take half the battle 
damage from your monster!

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:55.530
Aki!

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:05.740
Due to Ground Capture's effect, I draw one 
card if I take 1000 or more points in damage.

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:11.460
You only have 200 life points left.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.680
No matter what you try, it's pointless.

00:17:13.680 --> 00:17:16.570
I set one card and end my turn.

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:21.600
If I win this duel, Misty will vanish.

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:27.800
But if I only destroy Earthbound Immortal, 
there's a chance that Misty will survive.

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:30.660
My turn!

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:37.100
Due to Copy Plant’s 
monster effect, it becomes

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:40.100
the same Level as Dark 
Verger until the End Phase!

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:44.040
Then I summon Level 3 Hedge Guard!

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:49.480
Then I activate Shining Rebirth from my hand!

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:55.660
By sending the required 
monsters on the field to the

00:17:55.660 --> 00:18:00.460
graveyard, I can Synchro Summon one 
Synchro Monster from my graveyard.

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:04.430
I send Level 2 Dark Verger, 
Level 3 Hedge Guard

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:07.930
and Level 2 Copy Plant to 
the graveyard and tune them!

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:11.940
The cold flame envelops the entire world.

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:13.940
Black flower, bloom!

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:16.510
Synchro Summon!

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:20.210
Resurrect, Black Rose Dragon!

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:30.350
When Black Rose Dragon is successfully Synchro 
Summoned, it can destroy all cards on the field.

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:37.260
And due to Shining Rebirth's effect, Black 
Rose Dragon can't be destroyed this turn!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:39.050
Are you sure about this?

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:43.110
If you defeat me, this girl will also die.

00:18:43.110 --> 00:18:45.240
I'm going to defeat you, not Misty!

00:18:45.570 --> 00:18:47.940
Black Rose Dragon’s effect activates!

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:50.210
Black Rose Gale!

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:53.610
Destroy Earthbound Immortal Ccarayhua!

00:18:55.550 --> 00:19:01.950
You think that you can save this girl if you 
only destroy me, but I won’t let that happen!

00:19:02.130 --> 00:19:05.250
I activate the trap card Doom Gazer!

00:19:05.260 --> 00:19:10.180
When an effect that destroys cards 
on the field is activated...

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:13.770
...you take 300 points 
of damage for every card

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:17.270
that was destroyed and sent 
to the graveyard this turn.

00:19:18.810 --> 00:19:21.070
Seven cards were destroyed!

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:23.770
Therefore, you take 2100 points of damage!

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:25.440
You lose!

00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:31.120
Aki, since you're a Signer, 
you must protect this world!

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:33.380
Misty…

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:36.950
Remember us.

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:39.790
I flip over my trap card!

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:41.600
Nature's Reflection!

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:44.890
It reflects back your card’s effect damage!

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:47.960
Impossible!

00:19:52.010 --> 00:19:54.100
Thank you, Aki.

00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:56.390
Toby.

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:31.880
Are you okay, Aki?

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:33.530
Aki!

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:34.840
Aki!

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:37.590
What’s wrong, Aki?

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:40.850
Aki...

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:56.220
Misty...

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:57.450
Toby...

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:01.480
Aki...

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:04.670
I forgot about the sun!

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:05.810
Damn!

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:08.530
We didn’t make it before sunset.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:14.250
But everyone who were absorbed at the field 
should now have returned to the City.

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:20.270
This place is...

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:22.060
We…

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:23.690
We're back!

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:28.230
What?

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:32.370
What’s that?

00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:35.410
That’s in the direction of the City!

00:21:38.050 --> 00:21:39.850
What's that shape?

00:21:57.640 --> 00:22:02.110
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:02.470 --> 00:22:07.180
We will build our own future

00:22:07.650 --> 00:22:12.620
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:17.790
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:23.390 --> 00:22:32.930
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:38.500
This world can't be solved using algorithms

00:22:38.570 --> 00:22:43.210
Even if it loses its light

00:22:43.680 --> 00:22:48.480
The hourglass behind the 
heart can't be turned

00:22:48.480 --> 00:22:52.950
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:53.150 --> 00:22:58.530
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:58.660 --> 00:23:03.410
This journey has no end

00:23:03.630 --> 00:23:08.870
There's no meaning because there are no tears

00:23:09.300 --> 00:23:14.110
Hear my voice
